# Environment Variables

## Required in Production

- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` - Your site's domain (e.g., `https://xavkit.com`). **Must be set before deploying to production.** Used for canonical URLs and SEO metadata.

## Optional

None at this time.

## Example .env.local

```
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://xavkit.com
```

## Local Development

If `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` is not set, the app defaults to `http://localhost:3000` in development mode.

## Pre-Deployment Checklist

- [ ] Set `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` in your hosting platform's environment variables
- [ ] Verify the domain is correct (double-check for typos)
- [ ] Test the deployed site's sitemap.xml includes correct domain
- [ ] Verify canonical tags point to your actual domain, not example.com
